  "body": "Hi! I would like to migrate the definition of some terms from the [execCommand spec](https://w3c.github.io/editing/execCommand.html) into the HTML spec. This is due to the following reasons:\n1. There are terms that are defined in multiple specs, which could lead to confusion.\n2. There are terms that do not rely on the execCommand spec as their definitions reference DOM and HTML specs.\n3. Those terms are not exported\n4. execCommand is an 'unofficial' spec, which can lead to confusion due to its status.\n\n@marcoscaceres can provide more context as he has been working with the editor of the execCommand spec.\n\nI have started with migrating the `editing hosts` definition. Please let me know if there is anything I should improve. Thank you.\n\nThank you also to @marcoscaceres and @annevk for helping me with my questions about specs!\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5253/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 7, 2020, 4:48 AM UTC (1cdff6c)\">/dnd.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5253/d22075c...1cdff6c/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 7, 2020, 4:48 AM UTC (1cdff6c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5253/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 7, 2020, 4:48 AM UTC (1cdff6c)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5253/d22075c...1cdff6c/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 7, 2020, 4:48 AM UTC (1cdff6c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5253/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 7, 2020, 4:48 AM UTC (1cdff6c)\">/rende